 **Parameters with Typical Values:**
-- Kernel size ($k_d, k_h, k_w$): Typically $3 \times 3 \times 3$ or $5 \times 5 \times 5$.
-- Stride ($s$): Typically 1 for feature extraction, 2 for downsampling/upsampling.
